          "font size" : 12.0,
          "content" : "agreed between the contractor and ECDC and periodically revisited Collection (as needed) and validation of dataset. This is foreseen as a regular and constant activity through the course of the project. Deliverables includes scripts, datasets and epidemiological data summary. Format to be agreed during monthly teleconferences; cumulative data presented since the beginning of data collection. The format of the epidemiological data summary will be agreed with ECDC. The validation of the datasets will be performed in close collaboration with the countries/study sites and will be aimed to build capacity and foster a progressive improvement of data reported by the countries/sites over the course of the project.  Communication between the contractor and the countries/sites to validate the data will take place using principles agreed between the contractor and ECDC and periodically revisited."
